hildren":"Ephemeral"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"Recursive Reuse"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"Not Demonstrated"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"Evidence"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"Task Gain"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"System Boundary"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"Software Engineering Interfaces & Tools；以该论文实际可更新组件为边界，固定部分见下方判定。"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"Feedback"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"仓库 search 结果、编辑后的内容、语法检查、代码执行与测试输出。"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"Evidence Scope"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"接口来自人工行为分析和配置 search，运行中的 Agent 没有自动演化自身工具。它修改的是目标仓库，foundation model 也冻结。因此代码修改、execution feedback 与高分修复本身，均不足以构成 Recursive Self-Improvement。 已核验固定版本的相关方法与主要结果；未独立复现。"}]]}]]}],"$L10","$L11"]}]]]}],"$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18"]}],"$L19"]}]]}]
