1a:["$","section","method",{"id":"method","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"05"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Method & Worked Example"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"沿着输入、处理、输出走完 Pipeline。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"设计少量 search、定位、文件查看与局部编辑命令，在修改后直接展示新内容并检查语法。系统压缩旧观察，保留当前关键信息；model 交替提出操作和读取 execution feedback，直至提交修复补丁。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: SWE-agent: Agent-Computer Interfaces Enable Automated Software Engineering · v3","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"原文展示了带行号的 File Viewer 与按行替换的 Editor。输入 Issue 和仓库，Agent 搜索相关文件，打开有限行窗口，定位修改范围，提交编辑后立即读取更新的文件与检查反馈，再运行测试，输出 Patch。变化发生在任务仓库中；ACI 和底层 Model 在该任务循环中保持既定实现。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: SWE-agent: Agent-Computer Interfaces Enable Automated Software Engineering · v3","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
1b:["$","section","mathematics",{"id":"mathematics","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"06"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Mathematical Foundations"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"从符号、直觉与简单例子理解理论。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"主要贡献是系统设计，没有新的核心数学推导。用成功率与成本理解接口：更短 Observation 能节省 Token，但若删掉决定性证据，会降低任务成功率；更严格编辑检查能阻止语法错误，也可能增加回合。必须在统一任务和预算下测量这项取舍，不能单看命令数量。"}],["$","pre",null,{"className":"math-block","aria-label":"数学表达式","children":"Task success, tokens, turns, and edit failures\nshould be measured under the same ACI budget"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: SWE-agent: Agent-Computer Interfaces Enable Automated Software Engineering · v3","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
1c:["$","section","experiments",{"id":"experiments","children":[[["$","span","results",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"results"}],["$","span","observation",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"observation"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"07"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Experiments & Claims"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"Research Question → Experiment → Answer"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Question：特制 ACI 是否改善软件工程表现？→ Experiment：在 SWE-bench 与 HumanEvalFix 评估，并通过接口变体检查搜索、编辑及 Context 管理的作用。→ Answer：作者报告效果及行为差异，支持接口对固定 Model 的重要性；具体数字对应论文版本与 Benchmark 设置。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: SWE-agent: Agent-Computer Interfaces Enable Automated Software Engineering · v3","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"原论文中，GPT-4 Turbo 配合该接口在完整 SWE-bench 上解决 12.47% 的任务，在 Lite 子集解决 18.00%。这些是特定历史 model 与预算下的修复成绩，用于说明接口设计作用，不代表当前最高水平。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: SWE-agent: Agent-Computer Interfaces Enable Automated Software Engineering · v3","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
